{"id":"c83b656624a2acb7","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-generic-multiverse.md","title":"Generic Multiverse","display":"df-generic-multiverse — Generic Multiverse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-generic-multiverse","aliases":["58-df-generic-multiverse"],"display":"df-generic-multiverse — Generic Multiverse","depends_on":["[[58-df-ground]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-generic-multiverse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-generic-multiverse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generic-multiverse — Generic Multiverse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"58-df-ground\">58-df-ground</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model\">58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (transitive class model of ZFC)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_V\">\\(\\mathcal M_V\\)</span> (meta-collection of class models in the generic multiverse generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> is a ground of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"58-df-ground\">58-df-ground</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\\)</span> (exact transitive ZFC class-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model\">58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\)</span> (meta-collection of transitive class models of ZFC defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_0,\\ldots,W_n)\">\\((W_0,\\ldots,W_n)\\)</span> (a finite meta-sequence of class parameters; it is not a set-valued function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse\\text{-}models}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}} \\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\coloneqq\\{W:\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(W)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse\\text{-}models}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}} \\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\coloneqq\\{W:\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(W)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}} V\\in\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\to\\left[X\\in\\mathcal M_V\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists(W_0,\\ldots,W_n)\\in\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}^{\\langle n+1\\rangle}\\;\\left(W_0=V\\land W_n=X\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_i,W_{i+1})\\lor\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_{i+1},W_i)\\right)\\right)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}} V\\in\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\to\\left[X\\in\\mathcal M_V\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists(W_0,\\ldots,W_n)\\in\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}^{\\langle n+1\\rangle}\\;\\left(W_0=V\\land W_n=X\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_i,W_{i+1})\\lor\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_{i+1},W_i)\\right)\\right)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generic multiverse is generated by finite zigzags of set-forcing extensions and grounds.</li>\n<li>Both <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_V\">\\(\\mathcal M_V\\)</span> are meta-collections of class parameters. The finite path is a meta-sequence, not a ZFC set function whose values would be proper classes.</li>\n<li>The earlier formula included only one-step forcing extensions of the original <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>, so it was not closed under further forcing or downward moves.</li>\n<li>Class-sized closure can equivalently be presented as the least collection containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> and closed under these two operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ground","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ground]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model","status":"resolved","id":"150182b44c47c043","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ground","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)$ ($W$ is a ground of $U$, see [[58-df-ground]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model","status":"resolved","id":"150182b44c47c043","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S$ (exact transitive ZFC class-model predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}","display":false},{"tex":"(W_0,\\ldots,W_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse\\text{-}models}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}} \\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\coloneqq\\{W:\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(W)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}multiverse} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}} V\\in\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\to\\left[X\\in\\mathcal M_V\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists(W_0,\\ldots,W_n)\\in\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}^{\\langle n+1\\rangle}\\;\\left(W_0=V\\land W_n=X\\land\\forall i<n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_i,W_{i+1})\\lor\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_{i+1},W_i)\\right)\\right)\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":2031,"backlinks":[{"id":"87b6de91752d786a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-585","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-generic-multiverse.md|58-df-generic-multiverse]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["d0244462250ae67e","150182b44c47c043"]}